<section class="gg-hero">
  <div class="gg-hero-bg"></div>

  <div class="gg-container gg-hero-grid">
    <div class="gg-hero-copy reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Goal Grower Beta</span>
      <h1>Build goals you actually want to come back to.</h1>
      <p>
        Goal Grower turns habits and big goals into living plants, so progress feels visible,
        personal, and motivating instead of stressful.
      </p>

      <div class="gg-hero-actions">
        <a href="/pages/contact" class="gg-btn">Become a Tester</a>
        <a href="/pages/support" class="gg-btn-soft">Support the Project</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-hero-phones reveal">
      <div class="gg-floating-card card-a">
        <strong>Return</strong>
        <span>after imperfect days</span>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-floating-card card-b">
        <strong>Grow</strong>
        <span>one action at a time</span>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-phone main-phone">
        <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
        <div class="gg-phone-screen">
          {{ 'gg-exercise-more-before-placed-garden-view.png' | asset_img_url: '1000x' | img_tag: 'Goal Grower garden screen' }}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-phone side-phone">
        <div class="gg-phone-speaker small"></div>
        <div class="gg-phone-screen">
          {{ 'gg-exercise-more-only-goal-list-view.png' | asset_img_url: '700x' | img_tag: 'Goal Grower goals list screen' }}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-belief">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-belief-card reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">The idea</span>
      <h2>Your goals should feel alive.</h2>
      <p>
        Most trackers turn your life into checkboxes. Goal Grower gives your progress a place to live.
        Every goal becomes a plant. Every return matters. Every small action helps your garden grow.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-journey" id="how-it-works">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-section-heading reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">How it works</span>
      <h2>Progress becomes something you can see.</h2>
      <p>
        Goal Grower turns your goals into a simple emotional loop: begin, choose,
        grow, and understand.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-journey-layout">
      <div class="gg-journey-steps reveal">
        <div class="gg-journey-step active">
          <span>01</span>
          <h3>Begin with space</h3>
          <p>Start with a clean garden and decide what deserves your attention.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="gg-journey-step">
          <span>02</span>
          <h3>Choose what matters</h3>
          <p>Keep your goals visible instead of buried in another checklist.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="gg-journey-step">
          <span>03</span>
          <h3>Watch it grow</h3>
          <p>Your effort becomes a garden you can see and care about.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="gg-journey-step">
          <span>04</span>
          <h3>Understand progress</h3>
          <p>Use goal details to stay grounded, clear, and motivated.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-journey-visual reveal">
        <div class="gg-orbit orbit-one"></div>
        <div class="gg-orbit orbit-two"></div>

        <div class="gg-phone journey-phone phone-one">
          <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
          <div class="gg-phone-screen">
            {{ 'gg-no-goals-yet.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'No goals yet screen' }}
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="gg-phone journey-phone phone-two">
          <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
          <div class="gg-phone-screen">
            {{ 'gg-exercise-more-only-goal-list-view.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'Goal list screen' }}
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="gg-phone journey-phone phone-three">
          <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
          <div class="gg-phone-screen">
            {{ 'gg-exercise-more-before-placed-garden-view.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'Garden screen' }}
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="gg-phone journey-phone phone-four">
          <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
          <div class="gg-phone-screen">
            {{ 'gg-exercise-more-goal-details-view.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'Goal details screen' }}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-demo" id="demo">
  <div class="gg-container gg-demo-grid">
    <div class="gg-demo-copy reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker light">App demo</span>
      <h2>See how the garden grows.</h2>
      <p>
        Watch the current beta in motion. If the idea feels exciting, become a tester or support development
        and help shape what Goal Grower becomes next.
      </p>

      <div class="gg-hero-actions">
        <a href="/pages/contact" class="gg-btn">Join Testing</a>
        <a href="/pages/support" class="gg-btn-soft light-btn">Support Development</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-phone demo-phone reveal">
      <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
      <div class="gg-phone-screen">
        <video
          src="{{ 'Screen_Recording_goal-grower-runthrough.mp4' | asset_url }}"
          autoplay
          muted
          loop
          playsinline
          preload="metadata"
        ></video>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-shared">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-shared-card reveal">
      <div>
        <span class="gg-kicker">Shared gardens</span>
        <h2>Grow with people who are growing too.</h2>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p>
          Shared gardens help friends, spouses, classmates, and accountability partners work on their own goals
          while contributing to something together.
        </p>

        <div class="gg-pills">
          <span>Friends</span>
          <span>Family</span>
          <span>Classmates</span>
          <span>Partners</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-support-preview">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-section-heading reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Support the build</span>
      <h2>Help Goal Grower become real.</h2>
      <p>
        Your support helps fund testing, design, development, and future features.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-support-grid">
      <a href="/pages/contact" class="gg-support-card reveal">
        <span>Beta</span>
        <h3>Become a Tester</h3>
        <p>Try the app, give feedback, and help shape the experience.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/pages/support" class="gg-support-card reveal">
        <span>Mission</span>
        <h3>Support Development</h3>
        <p>Help fund the app while it grows from beta into release.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-support-card reveal">
        <span>Store</span>
        <h3>Shop Products</h3>
        <p>Support future apps, tools, and intentional growth products.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-final">
  <div class="gg-container reveal">
    <span class="gg-kicker">The mission</span>
    <h2>Grow a life you can keep returning to.</h2>
    <p>
      Goal Grower is for people who want progress to feel human, hopeful, and alive.
    </p>

    <div class="gg-hero-actions center">
      <a href="/pages/contact" class="gg-btn">Become a Tester</a>
      <a href="/pages/support" class="gg-btn-soft">Support the Project</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

